			"student" 3
			"researcher"
	message
		word
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in physics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in economics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in engineering!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in nanotechnology!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in genetics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in aerodynamics!"`
			`"Enthusiasm. I can't wait to go into academia after I graduate! I have a position lined up and everything!"`
			`"Gratitude. The appearance of those humans got me the funding I needed to complete my xenology mastery. Thank you, humanity!"`
			`"Joy. Midterms are finally over!"`
			`"Have you seen my homework, question?"`
			`"My professor refused to believe me when I said an Aberrant ate my homework, amusement."`
			`"Annoyance. The quality of education out here just isn't the same as back on Aviskir."`
			`"Annoyance. The quality of education out here just isn't the same as back on Livloua."`


news "avgi student frustrated"
	to show
		has "language: Avgi"
	location
		government "Avgi (Consonance)"
		not attributes "aberrant siege"
	name
		word
			"Avgi"
			"Struggling"
			"Frustrated"

		word
			" "
		word
			"student" 3
			"researcher"
	message
		word
			`"Frustration. I wanted to study political science, but all they teach out here is 'practical' subjects. And people wonder why the Assembly is filled with incompetents..."`
			`"Depression. I was going to study linguistics, but the university made me go into engineering instead. We already have enough engineers, what we need out here is culture!"`
			`"Anger. I wanted to study the arts, but I was ridiculed and accused of being a dead weight on society. Well, a society without art is no society at all!"`
			`"Anger. I wanted to study sociology, but that apparently isn't 'useful' to the War. Fools, the lot of them!"`
			`"Worry. I hope I can find a good job once I'm out of school, but I might have to just work in the shipyards for a few years."`
			`"Worry. I don't think I did well on that last exam."`
			`"Have you seen my homework, question?"`
			`"My professor refused to believe me when I said an Aberrant ate my homework, dejection."`
			`"Annoyance. The quality of education out here just isn't the same as back on Aviskir."`
			`"Annoyance. The quality of education out here just isn't the same as back on Livloua."`


