	"unique" 1
	description "A pendant made of the same crystalline rocks found on the Hai homeworld, fashioned after a Shield Beetle. A gift from Nanachi."
	description "	It comes with a finely crafted lit shadowbox so it can be installed and displayed with pride. A trio of mounting brackets - miniatures of those used on Quantum Keystones - provide a secure anchor to keep the pendant safe."
