	bay "Fighter" -43.5 2
		"launch effect" "human internal"
	bay "Fighter" 43.5 2
		"launch effect" "human internal"
	leak "leak" 50 50
	leak "flame" 50 80
	leak "big leak" 90 30
	explode "tiny explosion" 10
	explode "small explosion" 25
	explode "medium explosion" 25
	explode "large explosion" 10
	"final explode" "final explosion medium"
	description "The Lionheart Aerie is a light carrier, designed to be just big enough for four fighter bays plus a decent armament of its own. Variations on this same ship design have been in use in the Deep for almost half a millennium, but this model comes with the very latest in generator and weapon technology."



