planet Methuselah
	attributes "requires: gaslining"
	landscape land/methuselah
	description `This world feels ancient, and the air is calm as if the last storm ended millennia ago. A continuous deep sound from below seems to tell a story from the early days of the universe - memories of hotter and faster times.`
