planet "Outpost Leto"
	attributes asteroid avgi "avgi diaspora" "dissonance sympathies" station "tangled shroud"
	landscape land/station30
	music ambient/machinery
	description `Outpost Leto is one of the most recent constructions in the Tangled Shroud, built into a Kuiper belt object far from its primary. Large inflated domes, housing those unfortunate enough to be stationed here, dot an icy surface slathered in reddish tholins and chunks of frozen hydrocarbons. It is these very hydrocarbons and organic compounds that Outpost Leto was built to mine, shipping them in bulk to stations in the Outer Limits to support their environmental systems and ecosystems.`
	spaceport `The spaceport is hosted in one of the many pressurized domes adorning the surface of the planetoid, with a large airlock in the ceiling enabling passage between the station itself and the cold black of space outside.`
	outfitter "Avgi General"
	"required reputation" 10
	tribute 600
		threshold 4500
		fleet "Small Dissonance Pirates" 6
		fleet "Large Dissonance Pirates" 3

planet "Outpost Pilos"
	attributes avgi "avgi diaspora" station shipping
	landscape land/station53
	description `Outpost Pilos is a large early warning station set up soon after the Avgi decided to settle beyond the Tangled Shroud. Fearful of the Aberrant managing to overcome their supposed aversion to the mazelike region of space, it was quickly decided that a tripwire would be needed to warn of an incursion in the event of the fall of the Feo Platform and the infestation of the Tangled Shroud with Aberrations. However, when a large-scale attack never materialized, Outpost Pilos quickly found a second use as an intermediary waystation for the trade of minerals from the Tangled Shroud with the settlements beyond it.`
	description `	Enormous radar arrays and infrared telescopes make up the bulk of the station, but more recent additions include several large external bays where raw resources and cargo can be transferred between ships.`
	spaceport `The only amenities in what passes for the "spaceport" are a refueling station and small repair shop. As ships do not generally linger after refueling or transferring their cargo, a skeleton crew is the only permanent inhabitants of the station, and most accommodations are reserved for this crew.`
	"required reputation" 15
	security 0.5
	tribute 300
		threshold 3000
		fleet "Avgi Core Defense" 3
		fleet "Avgi Orbital Defense" 6
		fleet "Avgi Strike Group" 3
		fleet "Avgi Fleetgroup"

planet "Outpost Tekis"
	attributes asteroid avgi "avgi diaspora" "dissonance sympathies" station "tangled shroud"
	landscape land/station25
	music ambient/machinery
	description `Outpost Tekis is a station built into an enormous asteroid, with tunnels and habitats throughout its entire volume. Its surface is littered with pressurized tubes and habitat domes, many of which grow massive amounts of food in farms and gardens.`
	description `	The complex is a major exporter of titanium and other rare metals, which are otherwise very scarce in the metal-poor Tangled Shroud. A local chapter of the Dissonance movement is openly headquartered there, and is often the public face of negotiations with the Consonance's Assembly.`
	spaceport `The spaceport is somewhat cramped, being mostly intended for the intrasystem ships used in asteroid mining. A flexible docking arm allows larger ships to be moored off the asteroid, but you are able to barely squeeze your ship into the main hangar.`
	shipyard "Avgi Solar Light"
	shipyard "Avgi Solar Heavy"
	shipyard "Avgi Utility Ultralight"
