	description `	The newest revision of the EMP Torpedo Bay, the "Teciimach," contains two major improvements. The first is a mechanism on the launcher that alters each torpedoes' energy to ignore allies, letting Teciimachs be deployed without risk of ionizing yourself or the rest of your fleet.`
	description `	The second is a significant reduction in the size of the launcher hardware, allowing space for a clip that is a third larger.`
